{"chunk_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00000", "doc_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60", "version": 1, "seq": 0, "type": "text", "text": "# 第2章 部署\n\n本章介绍单机版 Milvus 的部署步骤。\n\n## 2.1 环境要求\n\nDocker 20.10 以上，内存不少于 16 GB。", "embed_text": "Milvus 部署手册 > 第2章 部署\n本章介绍单机版 Milvus 的部署步骤。\n\n## 2.1 环境要求\n\nDocker 20.10 以上，内存不少于 16 GB。", "content_hash": "e1ccdb9d10427bdfe80868974f7393ffb3d6ab0f2e837ea33cd360f3f6246b70", "tokens": 280, "section_path": ["第2章 部署"], "section_idx": 1, "section_tokens": 1500, "page_start": 11, "page_end": 11, "prev_id": null, "next_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00001", "image_ids": [], "related_ids": [], "image_path": null, "searchable": true, "meta": {"strategy": "section"}}
{"chunk_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00001", "doc_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60", "version": 1, "seq": 1, "type": "text", "text": "Milvus 的主配置文件是 milvus.yaml，位于容器的 /milvus/configs 目录。修改前先备份原文件，改完需要重启所有组件才会生效。", "embed_text": "Milvus 部署手册 > 第2章 部署 > 2.3 配置\nMilvus 的主配置文件是 milvus.yaml，位于容器的 /milvus/configs 目录。修改前先备份原文件，改完需要重启所有组件才会生效。", "content_hash": "8fbad1dcef8ff7c6ef4ed564d01e8b3a1d68ab07e1443c470487ec2e34782ea0", "tokens": 420, "section_path": ["第2章 部署", "2.3 配置"], "section_idx": 4, "section_tokens": 800, "page_start": 12, "page_end": 12, "prev_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00000", "next_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00002", "image_ids": [], "related_ids": [], "image_path": null, "searchable": true, "meta": {"strategy": "split", "split_part": "1/2", "overlap_chars": 0}}
{"chunk_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00002", "doc_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60", "version": 1, "seq": 2, "type": "text", "text": "修改前先备份原文件，改完需要重启所有组件才会生效。使用 DISKANN 索引时，必须把 queryNode.enableDisk 设为 true，否则加载集合会报错。磁盘索引的数据放在 localStorage.path 指定的目录，建议挂载 NVMe 盘。", "embed_text": "Milvus 部署手册 > 第2章 部署 > 2.3 配置\n(续 2/2)\n修改前先备份原文件，改完需要重启所有组件才会生效。使用 DISKANN 索引时，必须把 queryNode.enableDisk 设为 true，否则加载集合会报错。磁盘索引的数据放在 localStorage.path 指定的目录，建议挂载 NVMe 盘。", "content_hash": "0b36eab80fc5b8882076663e103b77319d05d3b3df16442fc02b44bceed5ffdd", "tokens": 400, "section_path": ["第2章 部署", "2.3 配置"], "section_idx": 4, "section_tokens": 800, "page_start": 12, "page_end": 12, "prev_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00001", "next_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00003", "image_ids": ["3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00004"], "related_ids": ["3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00003"], "image_path": null, "searchable": true, "meta": {"strategy": "split", "split_part": "2/2", "overlap_chars": 25}}
{"chunk_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00003", "doc_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60", "version": 1, "seq": 3, "type": "code", "text": "```bash\ndocker compose up -d\ndocker compose ps\n```", "embed_text": "Milvus 部署手册 > 第2章 部署 > 2.3 配置\n磁盘索引的数据放在 localStorage.path 指定的目录，建议挂载 NVMe 盘。\n```bash\ndocker compose up -d\ndocker compose ps\n```", "content_hash": "789065ef43c99f3d0d0d5dba1871936e151876f56234dae9ebea1fc3ee290757", "tokens": 20, "section_path": ["第2章 部署", "2.3 配置"], "section_idx": 4, "section_tokens": 800, "page_start": 13, "page_end": 13, "prev_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00002", "next_id": null, "image_ids": [], "related_ids": ["3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00002"], "image_path": null, "searchable": true, "meta": {"strategy": "code", "lang": "bash", "lead_in": "磁盘索引的数据放在 localStorage.path 指定的目录，建议挂载 NVMe 盘。"}}
{"chunk_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00004", "doc_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60", "version": 1, "seq": 4, "type": "image", "text": "图 2-1 部署架构", "embed_text": "Milvus 部署手册 > 第2章 部署 > 2.3 配置\n图 2-1 部署架构\n客户端经 Proxy 访问 QueryNode 与 DataNode", "content_hash": "11207c8db6759d2782bf616bfc96aca1061993c7a5403f7767a53ed93eb6d65d", "tokens": 8, "section_path": ["第2章 部署", "2.3 配置"], "section_idx": 4, "section_tokens": 800, "page_start": 13, "page_end": 13, "prev_id": null, "next_id": null, "image_ids": [], "related_ids": ["3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00002", "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00001", "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00003"], "image_path": "clean/3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60/v1/images/fig2-1.jpg", "searchable": true, "meta": {"strategy": "image", "anchor_id": "3f2a9c1e7b4d8a60:v1:00002"}}
